nce","r":"management","s":"Matt Young","x":"We are maintaining our guidance for Defitelio net sales for this year in a range of $155 million to $180 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/08/jazz-pharmaceuticals-jazz-q1-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"JAZZ 2019 Q1","e":"jazz","d":"2019-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Matt Young","x":"So again, taking into consideration just how we're running through the year at this juncture, we thought it was appropriate to maintain guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/08/jazz-pharmaceuticals-jazz-q1-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"JAZZ 2019 Q2","e":"jazz","d":"2019-08-06","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Matt Young","x":"We are also doing the market building and some of the hiring and activities in Europe in anticipation of our result in the European theater later this year or early next, and so, that's a big investment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/07/jazz-pharmaceuticals-jazz-q2-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"JAZZ 2019 Q2","e":"jazz","d":"2019-08-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bruce Cozadd","x":"We, for many years now, have not commented on forward thinking on price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/07/jazz-pharmaceuticals-jazz-q2-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"JAZZ 2019 Q2","e":"jazz","d":"2019-08-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Umer Raffat","x":"And secondly, there was a moderation in the pace of price increases for Xyrem last year, but I noticed with the July increase this year, there's sort of a move back toward the 9 to 10% range.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/07/jazz-pharmaceuticals-jazz-q2-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"JAZZ 2019 Q2","e":"jazz","d":"2019-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dan Swisher","x":"On the global growth side, just to really streamline our effort to get to market as quickly as possible, yes, we focused our regulatory interactions to-date with the FDA.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/07/jazz-pharmaceuticals-jazz-q2-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"JAZZ 2019 Q2","e":"jazz","d":"2019-08-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Matt Young","x":"We are maintaining our guidance for Defitelio net sales for this year in the range of 155 to 180 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/07/jazz-pharmaceuticals-jazz-q2-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"JAZZ 2019 Q3","e":"jazz","d":"2019-11-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Dan Swisher","x":"As we look forward to finishing the year strong, we have raised our guidance, and we continue to believe there's opportunity for -- on growth, both in volume and revenue for the Xyrem franchise.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/06/jazz-pharmaceuticals-jazz-q3-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"JAZZ 2019 Q4","e":"jazz","d":"2020-02-25","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Bruce Cozadd","x":"…the expectations we provided at launch last year regarding our view of the launch curve, which assumes key factors such as securing broad payer coverage and expanding the OSA prescriber base, which will position us to initiate a direct-to-consumer TV campaign later this year or early next year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/26/jazz-pharmaceuticals-jazz-q4-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"JAZZ 2019 Q4","e":"jazz","d":"2020-02-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bruce Cozadd","x":"In terms of rebating, we gave guidance on total revenues, which you can back into implies that we're going to realize probably less than half of the gross price increase we took earlier this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/26/jazz-pharmaceuticals-jazz-q4-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"JAZZ 2020 Q1","e":"jazz","d":"2020-05-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Renee Gala","x":"Taking our revenue and operating expense guidance changes into account, we are reducing our 2020 guidance for non-GAAP adjusted net income to a range of 630 to $700 million, and adjusted EPS to a range of $11.25 to $12.50.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/jazz-pharmaceuticals-jazz-q1-2020-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"JAZZ 2020 Q4","e":"jazz","d":"2021-02-23","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Daniel N. Swisher","x":"As we move into 2021, we're excited about the investments we're making in Sunosi with our expanded and dedicated sales force and our recent initiation of our TV DTC campaign.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/23/jazz-pharmaceuticals-plc-jazz-q4-2020-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"JAZZ 2021 Q1","e":"jazz","d":"2021-05-04","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Daniel N. Swisher","x":"We're continuing to invest in the promotion of Sunosi including our expanded and dedicated sales force in the ongoing direct-to-consumer TV campaign, which began early this year in the U.S. We're also pleased with the progress of our ongoing growing European launches of Sunosi.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/04/jazz-pharmaceuticals-plc-jazz-q1-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"JAZZ 2026 Q2","e":"jazz","d":"2026-08-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Philip Johnson","x":"…increase in SG&A driven by higher expenses for Modeyso and Ziihera first-line GEA, and to a lesser extent, by investments in key commercial capabilities and digital and AI, while the increase in R&D was driven by higher expenses related to clinical trial costs primarily related to zanidatamab.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/10/jazz-pharmaceuticals-jazz-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"JAZZ 2026 Q3","e":"jazz","d":"2026-11-02","l":"dtc","r":"analyst","s":"Ashwani Verma","x":"How would the ramp here for GEA compared to how fast Ziihera got adopted in the DTC seg